{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，当 flavor='seurat_v3' 时，输入期望是计数数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，当前标记为 raw_integer_counts 的矩阵在表示类型上符合 seurat_v3 的计数输入期望。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "in which count data is expected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "seurat_v3 会先对每个基因做带正则化标准差的标准化，再计算标准化后方差并按该方差排序。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "First, the data are standardized (i.e., z-score normalization per feature) with a regularized standard deviation. Next, the normalized variance is computed as the variance of each gene after the transformation. Genes are ranked by the normalized variance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：文档片段显示 n_top_genes 在 flavor='seurat_v3' 时是必填参数；这属于参数存在性要求，不代表对输入矩阵另有表示类型限制。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "n_top_genes\n        Number of highly-variable genes to keep. Mandatory if `flavor='seurat_v3'`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "在未提供 counts 层且 batch_key 为 null 的条件下，当前矩阵可直接作为 adata.X 输入；下一步应显式传入 n_top_genes=2000 并调用 highly_variable_genes。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": ""
}
